<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">你的节奏，你的进步</view><view class="title">每一点坚持，<text>{{'\n'}}</text>都算数。</view><view wx:if="{{vm.entitlement || vm.report.weekStart}}"><view class="tag">{{vm.report.weekStart || '尚未开始'}} · {{vm.config.workoutPlansSupported?'自然周回顾':vm.day>=7?'7 天回顾':'阶段记录'}}</view><view class="report-hero"><view class="report-number">{{vm.report.trainingDays}}<text>/ {{vm.report.plannedTrainingDays}}</text></view><view>训练日已完成</view><progress class="native-progress" percent="{{vm.report.completion}}" stroke-width="4" activeColor="#57A885" backgroundColor="#DEE5D9" border-radius="4"/></view><view class="stats"><view><text class="stat-number">{{vm.report.sessions}}</text><text class="muted">次完成训练</text></view><view><text class="stat-number">{{vm.report.nutritionDays}}</text><text class="muted">天饮食任务</text></view></view><view class="section-title">留给下一步的建议</view><view class="body-copy">{{vm.report.sessions ? '先保持能坚持的节奏。结合训练感受，选择适合自己的难度；不需要因为漏练而集中补练。' : '记录还不多，暂不判断身体或力量变化。先从一次适合自己的训练开始。'}}</view><view class="notice">本报告统计实际记录；未填写的数据不会按 0 推断。7 天侧重建立习惯，不据此判断体型改变。</view><view wx:if="{{vm.pending}}" class="sync">包含 {{vm.pending}} 项本机记录，联网后自动备份</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="subscribe">订阅下一次任务提醒</button><navigator class="primary" url="/pages/today/index" open-type="switchTab" hover-class="navigator-hover">回到今日</navigator></view><view wx:else class="empty">完成评估并开始挑战后，这里会呈现你的真实记录。<navigator class="primary" url="/pages/assessment/index" hover-class="navigator-hover">找到训练起点</navigator></view></view>
